      "worked": "Both inequalities must hold: $y=2x-1$ must be at or below $y=5$, and $y=4x+3$ must be at or above $y=5$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}2x-1&\\le 5\\\\2x&\\le 6\\\\x&\\le 3\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}4x+3&\\ge 5\\\\4x&\\ge 2\\\\x&\\ge \\frac12\\end{align*}$$\n\nTaking the common solution gives $\\frac12\\le x\\le 3$.",
